[ti:लाडो बसंती मेहमान]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Folk & Regional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00][Verse 1 - Yaman]: Male soft: "ये जो मेहमान बनके आए हो तुम, हमारे यहाँ" Female lip whistle. Male: "ये रिवाज ज्यादा न चलेगा" Female "रु रु रु" breathy. Male: "आओ तो रुक कर जाना" Female "हाय... हम्म". Male: "तेरी शगर्दी में तितलियों सा उड़ेगा इन्सान" Female soft whistle. Women's chorus under.
[00:31.32][Hook - Khamaj]: Male fuller: "मेरी लाडो बसंती, तू क्यों नहीं सुनती" twice. Female "रु रु रु" with lip whistle. Khartal wood clappers every 8 beats. Algoza double flute enters.
[00:54.64][Verse 2 - Khamaj playful]: Male: "तेरी छन छन से रोशन मजार" Female "छन् न् न्". Male: "तेरे आने से slow motion सवार" Female humming. Male warning: "मैंने बताया था चंचल लौंडे बहुत हैं" Female laughing "रु रु रु". Tumbi plucks on warning lines.
[01:17.96][Verse 3 - Bageshri slow]: Male: "इस बार कुछ ऐसा हो तो बताना जरूर" Female long breath "हाय". Male: "तुम्हारे उड़ने के चर्चे पहुँच रहे हैं" Female seductive hum. Male: "खुले झाड़ियों वाले बगीचे बहुत हैं" Female fading "रु रु रु". Morchang jaw harp metallic twang.
[01:41.28][Verse 4 - Bageshri peak]: Male raw, voice breaking: "तेरे लबों के शहद की बातें सब कर रहे हैं" Female "हाय रे हाय". Male breaking completely: "शक्ल तक नज़र पहुँची ही नहीं, जब जब तुम आई" Female long painful "रु उ उ उ". Women's chorus loud. Morchang.
[02:04.60][BANDISH - Bageshri, ati vilambit teentaal (extremely slow 16 beats), tabla enters softly then drops out]:
[02:27.92]Male alone, turning away from her, singing to himself, to the night, to God. Voice tired. Cracks allowed. No female response. No women's chorus.
[02:51.24]बिन देखे ही रट लागी
[03:14.56]बिन मिले ही घट जागी
[03:37.88]लाडो... लाडो...
[04:01.20]कहाँ गई तू, कहाँ गई
[04:24.52]Antarā (higher octave, voice straining):
[04:47.84]तेरे बिना की रात कटे ना
[05:11.16]तेरे बिना का साँझ ढले ना
[05:34.48]आँखों में तू, साँसों में तू
[05:57.80]पर हाथ ना आई, हाथ ना आई
[06:21.12]Return to Sthāyī, slower each line. Tabla drops out after second cycle. Male's own claps continue (khali on offbeat). Then claps stop. Only voice. Then voice cracks. Then only the word "लाडो" repeated. Then only breath. Then silence.
[06:44.44][Hook final - Bhairavi modulation, no bandish, returning to original form]: Male + women together, but male voice now fragile: "मेरी लाडो बसंती, तू क्यों नहीं सुनती" twice. Female ghost whisper (very faint, as if from another house): "हाय... हम्म... रु रु रु".
[07:07.76][Outro - Bhairavi]: Sarangi crying. Ravanahatha enters with slack gut string, bent notes. Male spoken-sung, dry, no reverb: "मतलब नज़रें झूठा कर रही हैं अमीर" Female barely audible "हम्म". Male, voice steady but false: "अबसे मैं आया करूँगा, तुम मत आना हमारे यहाँ" Female whispers away, fading completely: "रु रु रु". Women's chorus one voice, then none. No tanpura. No beat. No drone. No instrument.
[07:31.08][Ending - spoken, no music, no instrument, no reverb]: Male spoken alone in empty room, dawn light, to the empty chair: "मैं एक दिन आऊँगा... तुम्हारे यहाँ
